me_id":"steam-3986580","kind":"announcement","title":"15,000+ Wishlists on Steam! 🎉","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has followed the game, added it to their wishlist, shared it with friends, and supported us along the way. Your excitement means everything to the team.We can’t wait to show you more soon. 💙","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T12:41:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314351437","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3986580-1838407329269558","game_id":"steam-3986580","kind":"announcement","title":"7,500 Wishlists on Steam, Thank You!","summary":"We are excited to announce that FLING UP TOGETHER has officially reached 7,500 wishlists on Steam! This is an important milestone for our team, and we could not have reached it without your support. Every wishlist, playtest, message, video, and share has helped more players discover the game. We truly appreciate everyone who has supported us throughout development. We are continuing to improve the game, review player feedback, and prepare more updates to share with you. Thank you for being part ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T17:06:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329269558","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:16:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3986580-1838407329257464","game_id":"steam-3986580","kind":"update","title":"Demo 2.0 Update is now Live!!!!","summary":"Demo 2.0 for FLING UP TOGETHER is live right now, and it's free.Over the past few months we've been reading every comment, Discord message, and review, and this update is our answer. Here's what's new:What's changed in Demo 2.0Character improvements: your little Character looks 